{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281220","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028122001:0":{"text":"정말 고마워요... 흩어진 마력을 모두 되찾았으니 금방 힘을 회복할 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"谢谢你们……逸散的魔力全部找回，我想，很快力量就能完全...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A2EDA923D0DD58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028122002:0":{"text":"그리고 여러분 덕분에 근처의 몬스터들도 다 소탕했어요. 마력이 유인하지 않는다면 더는 나타나지 않을 거예요...","source_cn":"而且多亏了你们，这附近的魔物也被清除干净了，没有魔力作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA284DC9D4186AABB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028122003:0":{"text":"이제 모두 즐겁고 평화로운 생활로 돌아갈 수 있겠네요.","source_cn":"这样，大家就又可以开开心心、安安稳稳地生活了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D86DAC94DFDB305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028122004:0":{"text":"후후, 마스터가 워낙 대단해서죠. 물론 치피와 해미의 노력도 있고요!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，主要是主人很厉害。当然啦，满满和漫漫也出了力的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x800586C57D84366C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"후후, 마스터가 워낙 대단해서죠. 물론 치피와 해미의 노력도 있고요!","female":"후후, 마스터가 워낙 대단해서죠. 물론 치피와 해미의 노력도 있고요!","variant_male_record_index":"112402","variant_female_record_index":"112403","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028122005:1":{"text":"휴윈 양, 연인의 소원으로 돌아가실 건가요?","source_cn":"伊温小姐，你要回情人之愿了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E17D28431653672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028122006:0":{"text":"네, 같이 가주실 수 있나요? 주고 싶은... 선물이 있어요.","source_cn":"嗯，你们可以一起来吗？我……我有些东西想送给你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01ECE4834505C624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}